    This is the application definition for raw data from a kappa geometry 
    (CAD4) single crystal
    diffractometer. It extends :ref:`NXxbase`, so the full definition is 
    the content of :ref:`NXxbase` plus the
    data defined here.
  </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXxkappa</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXxkappa.html</rdfs:seeAlso>
  <extends rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">NXxbase</extends>
