                and assure a stable numerical integration.
                Whichever criterion is fulfilled first stops the simulation.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_score_config.html#nxmicrostructure-score-config-entry-numerics-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

