  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXtransmission.html#nxtransmission-entry-instrument-spectrometer-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
