  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXapm_reconstruction.html#nxapm-reconstruction-naive-discretization-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
