                    the energy of the source is not the optical power of the beam, but the energy of the electron beam
                    in a synchrotron or similar.
                </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-instrument-source-probe-group</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

