                    This group is to be used for any additional beams that are not described by
                    :ref:`beam_probe &lt;/NXmpes/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/beam_probe-group&gt;` or
                    :ref:`beam_pump &lt;/NXmpes/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/beam_pump-group&gt;`.
                    
