  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                        Are targets assigned to the noise category or not.
                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXapm_paraprobe_clusterer_results.html#nxapm-paraprobe-clusterer-results-entry-cluster-analysisid-dbscanid-is-noise-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
