  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
             Which representation does the formula evaluate to.
             This may either be n for refractive index or eps for dielectric function.
             The appropriate token is then to be used inside the formula.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXdispersion_function.html#nxdispersion-function-representation-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
