                An array with as many pairs as interfaces or their projections.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure.html#nxmicrostructure-interfaces-indices-crystal-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

