  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                The Kf coefficient, called loop filter gain, determines the gain of the
                loop filter circuit in the PLL.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXphase_lock_loop.html#nxphase-lock-loop-loop-filter-kf-coefficient-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
