  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">
                The time taken to settle the bias voltage at the desired value. On each sweep usually, the system
                takes time to settle the bias voltage at the next value.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXspm_bias_spectroscopy.html#nxspm-bias-spectroscopy-bias-sweep-settling-time-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
