                volume has been extracted from the specimen.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXapm_reconstruction.html#nxapm-reconstruction-config-voltage-filter-final-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
