            For each triangle values are reported for the angle opposite
            to the respective edges in the sequence how vertices are defined.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_triangle.html#nxcg-triangle-interior-angle-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#nxcg-unit-normal-normals-field">
