                cleaner description. Suggestions from the community are
                welcome here for guiding an improvement of this base class.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcorrector_cs.html#nxcorrector-cs-tableauid-tilt-angle-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

