             For symmetry-guided distortion correction. Here we record the coordinates of the
             relevant symmetry points.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXdistortion.html#nxdistortion-original-points-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

