            For higher-order multipoles, it is an array.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXelectromagnetic_lens.html#nxelectromagnetic-lens-current-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

<owl:Class rdf:about="#nxelectromagnetic-lens-type-field">
