            Dimensionality of the structure.
        </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXunit_cell.html#nxunit-cell-dimensionality-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
