  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enumeration item for NXoptical_spectroscopy/ENTRY/INSTRUMENT/beam_TYPE/parameter_reliability: nominal</rdfs:comment>
