                        used to control any parts of the optical spectroscopy setup.
                        The uppercase TYPE should be replaced by a specification name, i.e.
                        "software_detector" or "software_stage" to specify the respective
                        program or software components.
                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXoptical_spectroscopy.html#nxoptical-spectroscopy-entry-instrument-software-type-program-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

