  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Defines the last device right in front of the sample used to shape the beam. This could be, for example, a :ref:`(radial) collimator &lt;NXcollimator&gt;` or a :ref:`slit &lt;NXslit&gt;`.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXstress.html#nxstress-entry-instrument-beam-intensity-profile-primary-vertical-type-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

