                    </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXxps.html#nxxps-entry-instrument-beam-probe-depends-on-field</rdfs:seeAlso>
