                Should be a valid NeXus path name, e.g., /entry/instrument/detector/raw.
            </rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcalibration.html#nxcalibration-original-axis-input-path-attribute</rdfs:seeAlso>
</owl:Class>

